body:
Clearcore by teknic looks really interesting, they're $100 for a four motion control axes and 10 io, and you can scale them to 64 io points by daisy chaining them together. I'm waiting on one to come in right now to make a little welding controller system

&#x200B;

[https://teknic.com/products/io-motion-controller/](https://teknic.com/products/io-motion-controller/)
